OL,3,GNEWSABrighton's West Pier and its
OL,4,Abattle with nature
OL,5,
OL,6,F"You have to experience it to know how
OL,7,Fmuch it means to people. It's like a
OL,8,Frelationship, and I feel incredibly
OL,9,Fbonded to it," Secker said.
